# Personal Agent Integration for Cursor

## Code Review
Before committing changes, run personal-agent for an independent review:
```bash
pa --investigate "Review changes for correctness and security" --repo .
```

## Fix Issues
Use the full worker/arbiter loop to fix problems:
```bash
pa "Fix the issue described here" --repo . -c "pytest tests/" --max-iter 3
```

## Investigation
Investigate the codebase without changes:
```bash
pa --investigate "Explain the architecture of this module" --repo .
```

## Python API
```python
import asyncio
from personal_agent import CodingAgent, Task, Decision

async def review():
    agent = CodingAgent(".")
    result = await agent.run(Task(
        description="Fix the failing test",
        commands=["pytest tests/"],
    ))
    if result.decision == Decision.ACCEPT:
        print(result.final_diff)

asyncio.run(review())
```

## Environment
Set at least one free-tier provider key: COHERE_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, CEREBRAS_API_KEY, or GEMINI_API_KEY. All providers offer free-tier access — no paid keys required. Set multiple for automatic failover.
